---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <span class="note">
    I wrote here regularly between 2005 and 2014. Those posts are
    <a href="/writing/">still up</a>, at the addresses they've always had.
  </span>
  <span class="where">Windsor, Ontario &middot; {year}</span>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .note {
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .where {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--faint);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
